1
00:00:01,213 --> 00:00:03,443
Let's see who dares kick me out

2
00:00:03,443 --> 00:00:05,933
I'm carrying the Jiang family's blood

3
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,530
This is your grandson

4
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,290
Would you let him wander the streets?

5
00:00:13,213 --> 00:00:14,725
Stop pretending

6
00:00:14,725 --> 00:00:16,005
At your age

7
00:00:16,005 --> 00:00:17,835
how could you even get pregnant?

8
00:00:17,835 --> 00:00:19,465
We're at a hospital

9
00:00:19,465 --> 00:00:20,695
How could I lie?

10
00:00:20,695 --> 00:00:22,475
Son, I'm begging you

11
00:00:22,475 --> 00:00:24,035
I'm already ruined

12
00:00:24,035 --> 00:00:26,255
The Jiang family's only heir

13
00:00:26,255 --> 00:00:27,215
Get up

14
00:00:27,215 --> 00:00:29,805
I exposed my husband's affair with the maid

15
00:00:29,805 --> 00:00:31,365
and was killed for it

16
00:00:31,365 --> 00:00:32,475
This life

17
00:00:32,475 --> 00:00:34,735
your whole family will pay in blood

18
00:00:34,735 --> 00:00:36,515
Xiaolan, come on

19
00:00:36,515 --> 00:00:38,035
Come wash my feet

20
00:00:38,035 --> 00:00:40,145
Zhang Guifen, don't push it

21
00:00:40,145 --> 00:00:41,235
Oh my

22
00:00:41,235 --> 00:00:43,025
My precious son says

23
00:00:43,025 --> 00:00:45,505
he wants grandma serving him personally

24
00:00:45,505 --> 00:00:47,265
If she doesn't serve well

25
00:00:47,265 --> 00:00:48,655
he won't come out

26
00:00:48,655 --> 00:00:50,195
He'll just stay in there

27
00:00:50,195 --> 00:00:51,815
Let's see who panics

28
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,490
You little sweetheart

29
00:00:53,490 --> 00:00:54,320
Honey

30
00:00:54,547 --> 00:00:56,167
Honey, calm down

31
00:00:56,413 --> 00:00:58,553
Careful of the baby in her belly

32
00:00:58,553 --> 00:01:00,293
If it weren't for the baby

33
00:01:00,293 --> 00:01:02,573
carrying the Jiang family's blood

34
00:01:02,573 --> 00:01:04,543
I'd have thrown you out already

35
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:11,050
Don't hurt the baby

36
00:01:12,147 --> 00:01:13,527
Something's wrong

37
00:01:13,527 --> 00:01:15,547
The way Jiang Chengang looked

38
00:01:15,547 --> 00:01:17,977
that's not how you look at a daughter-in-law

39
00:01:21,213 --> 00:01:22,713
Oh, Chengang

40
00:01:22,713 --> 00:01:23,953
Gently now

41
00:01:23,953 --> 00:01:25,593
I'm carrying your child

42
00:01:25,593 --> 00:01:26,853
Don't crush it

